xt w-inline-block"><div>Pricing</div><div class="dropdown-link-icon-wrapper"><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/></div></a><a id="w-node-_410aadc6-2821-bb51-9593-bde96e0f7e46-6e0f7df9" href="/trading/faq" class="dropdown-link dark-text w-inline-block"><div>Frequently Asked Questions</div><div class="dropdown-link-icon-wrapper"><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/></div></a></div></div></nav></div><a href="/market-data" class="nav-link inside-left-link w-nav-link">Market Data</a><div data-delay="200" data-hover="true" class="nav-link w-dropdown"><div class="dropdown-toggle w-dropdown-toggle"><div>Company</div><div class="dropdown-arrow-wrapper"><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb7c_interface-icon-arrow-down-dark.svg" class="dropdown-toggle-icon"/><img alt="" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb7c_interface-icon-arrow-down-dark.svg" class="dropdown-toggle-icon"/></div></div><nav class="dropdown-list-wrapper w-dropdown-list"><div class="dropdown-list"><div class="dropdown-links"><a href="/company/about" class="dropdown-link dark-text w-inline-block"><div>About</div><div class="dropdown-link-icon-wrapper"><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/></div></a><a href="/company/careers" aria-current="page" class="dropdown-link dark-text w-inline-block w--current"><div>Careers</div><div class="dropdown-link-icon-wrapper"><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/></div></a><a href="/company/contact" class="dropdown-link dark-text w-inline-block"><div>Contact</div><div class="dropdown-link-icon-wrapper"><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/><img alt="Arrow right" src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3d_interface-icon-arrow-right-small.svg" class="dropdown-link-icon"/></div></a></div></div></nav></div><a href="/news" class="nav-link inside-left-link w-nav-link">News</a><a href="/company/contact" class="button inside-nav-menu white mobilemenu w-inline-block"><div>Contact Us</div></a></div></nav></div><div class="navbar-right-contents"><a href="#" class="trigger-search-modal w-inline-block"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb3c_interface-icon-search-dark.svg" alt="" class="search-icon"/><div class="search-text">Search</div></a><div class="menu-button w-nav-button"><div class="menu-button-wrapper"><div class="menu-button-horziontal"><div class="menu-button-horizontal-line line-1"></div><div class="menu-button-horizontal-line line-2"></div><div class="menu-button-horizontal-line line-3"></div></div><div class="menu-button-cross"><div class="menu-button-cross-line line-1"></div><div class="menu-button-cross-line line-2"></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eaa5_icon-cross.svg" alt="" class="nav-menu-close"/><div class="w-embed w-script"><style>
/* Navbar V2 (reverse colour, light pages) dropdown tweaks — mirror of the Navbar V2 - White embed.
   Scoped to .navbar-wrapper:not(.white) so the white navbar is untouched. */

/* Panel: very translucent light glass instead of the solid light-tone background */
.navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-list {
  background-color: transparent;
  background-image: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(246, 249, 255, .30) 0%, rgba(246, 249, 255, .42) 100%);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(160%);
  backdrop-filter: blur(14px) saturate(160%);
  border: 1px solid var(--border-dark, rgba(31, 39, 27, .2)); /* same stroke as the light pages' dividers */
}

/* Tiles: same corner radius as .button (Explore CIX); every tile is the height of a one-line tile, two-line labels grow upward */
.navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-link {
  border-radius: 4px;
  --tile-space: 72px; /* the original top padding */
  height: calc(var(--tile-space) + 12px + 1.5em);
  height: calc(var(--tile-space) + 12px + 1lh);
  padding-top: 12px;
  align-items: flex-end;
}

/* Arrow: one arrow, centred on the label's last line. The wrapper holds two copies that the
   "Dropdown Link - Hover In" Webflow interaction slides across; here GSAP animates the wrapper
   instead, so hide the spare copy and pin the other against the interaction's inline transform. */
.navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-link-icon-wrapper {
  flex: none;
  margin-left: 12px;
  margin-bottom: calc((1lh - 16px) / 2);
}
.navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-link-icon-wrapper .dropdown-link-icon:not(:last-child) { display: none; }
.navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-link-icon-wrapper .dropdown-link-icon { flex: none; transform: none !important; }

/* Hidden until hovered; GSAP animates it in (the class is added by the script, so without JS arrows show as normal) */
.cix-nav-arrows-rev .navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-link-icon-wrapper { opacity: 0; visibility: hidden; }

@media screen and (max-width: 479px) {
  .navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-link { --tile-space: 60px; }
}
</style>
<script>
// Dropdown arrows glide in on hover/focus (GSAP). Touch devices keep the arrows visible.
(function () {
  if (!window.matchMedia('(hover: hover) and (pointer: fine)').matches) return;
  var reduce = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;

  function init() {
    var gsap = window.gsap;
    var links = document.querySelectorAll('.navbar-wrapper:not(.white) .dropdown-link');
    if (!gsap || !links.length) return;
    document.documentElement.classList.add('cix-nav-arrows-rev');

    links.forEach(function (link) {
      var icon = link.querySelector('.dropdown-link-icon-wrapper');
      if (!icon) return;
      gsap.set(icon, { autoAlpha: 0, x: -10, filter: 'blur(2px)' });

      function show() {
        gsap.to(icon, { autoAlpha: 1, x: 0, filter: 'blur(0px)', duration: reduce ? 0 : 0.32, ease: 'power3.out', overwrite: true });
      }
      function hide() {
        gsap.to(icon, {
          autoAlpha: 0, x: 6, filter: 'blur(2px)', duration: reduce ? 0 : 0.18, ease: 'power2.in', overwrite: true,
          onComplete: function () { gsap.set(icon, { x: -10 }); }
        });
      }
      link.addEventListener('mouseenter', show);
      link.addEventListener('focus', show);
      link.addEventListener('mouseleave', hide);
      link.addEventListener('blur', hide);
    });
  }

  // Wait for the page (and any GSAP it loads in its footer); only fetch GSAP if the page doesn't have it.
  function start() {
    if (window.gsap) return init();
    var s = document.createElement('script');
    s.src = 'https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/gsap@3.12.5/dist/gsap.min.js';
    s.onload = init;
    document.head.appendChild(s);
  }
  if (document.readyState === 'loading') document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', start);
  else start();
})();
</script>
</div></div><section class="section careers-title"><div class="container---main careers-title-container"><div class="careers-title halves"><div class="careers-title-left"><h1 class="display-heading">Careers</h1><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67ed7d2fb55593f4a1c7c3b3_Modern%20Office%20Scene.jpeg" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67ed7d2fb55593f4a1c7c3b3_Modern%20Office%20Scene-p-500.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67ed7d2fb55593f4a1c7c3b3_Modern%20Office%20Scene-p-800.jpeg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67ed7d2fb55593f4a1c7c3b3_Modern%20Office%20Scene-p-1080.jpeg 1080w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67ed7d2fb55593f4a1c7c3b3_Modern%20Office%20Scene.jpeg 1200w" class="rounded-image"/></div><div id="w-node-_04481dd6-bf4b-e7c0-2586-cdae7eb243cc-6fb2eb03" class="careers-title-right"><div class="careers-title-cta"><div class="heading-three">At CIX, you’re not just part of the innovation process, you’re leading it.</div><a href="#openings" class="button orange w-inline-block"><div>View Openings</div></a></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section title bg-dark-tone"><div class="container---main"><h3 class="heading-two title-text">Work at CIX</h3></div></section><section class="bg-dark-tone border-top-white"><div class="container---main"><div class="thirds-grid"><div class="benefit-box"><div class="heading-four">Frontline Innovation</div><div class="body-text-light-tone">At CIX, you&#x27;re stepping into the engine room of financial transformation. This is where Canadian markets evolve—through next-generation ATS technology, AI-driven execution, and market structure innovation. Every line of code you write, every trading model you refine, and every regulatory framework you help shape directly impacts how capital flows in Canada. <br/><br/>We operate at the intersection of finance and cutting-edge technology, where rapid prototyping meets real-world market impact. Here, you don&#x27;t just follow industry trends—you set them.</div></div><div class="benefit-box"><div class="heading-four">Competitive Benefits</div><div class="body-text-light-tone">CIX invests in you as aggressively as we&#x27;re transforming markets. Our compensation packages rival top tech and finance firms, with performance bonuses, equity participation that grows with your success. Health and wellness are prioritized through comprehensive medical, dental, and mental health coverage, while our flexible work policy recognizes that groundbreaking ideas don&#x27;t always happen between 9 and 5. <br/><br/>We&#x27;ve built a benefits framework that removes barriers so you can focus on what matters—changing how Canada trades.</div></div><div class="benefit-box benefit border-left-white"><div class="heading-four">Career Growth</div><div class="body-text-light-tone">At CIX, your career trajectory is limited only by your ambition. We&#x27;re building Canada&#x27;s most dynamic trading platform, and that requires talent that thinks exponentially. <br/><br/>Whether you&#x27;re an engineer pioneering our matching algorithms, a trader optimizing execution quality, or a compliance expert shaping regulatory frameworks, you&#x27;ll have direct access to leadership and opportunities that typically take years elsewhere. Mentorship comes from industry veterans who&#x27;ve built exchanges, while our flat structure ensures your voice drives real change. This isn&#x27;t just professional development—it&#x27;s career acceleration at market speed.</div></div></div></div></section><section id="open-positions" class="section title"><div class="container---main"><h3 id="openings" class="heading-two title-text">Current Opportunities</h3></div></section><section class="section"><div class="container---main"><div class="careers-list-section"><div class="careers-list-section-aside"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67ed761bebdf3413e3bd8b57_Blurred%20Data%20Center%20View.jpeg" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67ed761bebdf3413e3bd8b57_Blurred%20Data%20Center%20View-p-500.jpeg 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67ed761bebdf3413e3bd8b57_Blurred%20Data%20Center%20View-p-800.jpeg 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67ed761bebdf3413e3bd8b57_Blurred%20Data%20Center%20View.jpeg 849w" alt="" class="rounded-image"/><div class="sidebar-cta"><div class="narrow-text">We’re always looking for passionate and talented people. If this sounds like you, reach out via our contact page.</div><a href="/company/contact" class="button orange w-inline-block"><div>Contact us </div></a></div></div><div class="careers-list-wrapper"><div class="collection-list-wrapper w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="job-list w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="w-dyn-item"><a href="/jobs/network-specialist" class="job w-inline-block"><div class="job-title-link-wrapper"><div class="heading-four job-name">Network Specialist</div><div class="job-link-arrow"><img src="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2ea31/67e9f1cfde2a97896fb2eb39_interface-icon-arrow-up-right.svg" alt="Arrow pointing up and right"/></div></div><div class="job-meta-wrapper"><div class="article-meta-item job-listing-meta"><div class="bullet-circle bg-dark-tone"></div><div class="small-text ft">Full-Time</div></div><div class="article-meta-item job-listing-meta"><div class="bullet-circle bg-dark-tone"></div><div class="job-city-country-wrapper location"><div class="small-text">Toronto, Canada (Hybrid)</div><div class="small-text">, </div><div class="small-text">Canada</div></div></div></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><div class="footer"><div class="container---main"><div class="footer-columns"><div class="footer-left-column"><di